00:30:18.500 --> 00:30:20.500
In a streak? Not in a streak.

00:30:20.620 --> 00:30:24.300
Oh, okay. But you do get a lot of points just for getting the numbers in order too,

00:30:24.380 --> 00:30:27.480
which I thought was nice because there's like two different ways to play the game.

00:30:27.640 --> 00:30:30.380
One would be to get a lot of points by streaking it,

00:30:30.520 --> 00:30:32.360
going to the next most obvious ball,

00:30:32.400 --> 00:30:35.680
and then the other one, if you are okay with losing some lives,

00:30:36.060 --> 00:30:38.460
might be to try and just get the numbers in order

00:30:38.460 --> 00:30:40.260
so this way you get a bigger streak that way.

00:30:40.820 --> 00:30:44.920
I think by doing the numbers and just pocketing the balls in general,

00:30:44.920 --> 00:30:48.920
